    "Id": "chassisdef_maxwell_MXW-775",
    "Name": "Maxwell",
    "Details": "The Maxwell MXW-775 mounts a Gauss Rifle backed by five medium lasers, allowing it to fire continuously without heat trouble. Its main weakness lies in ammunition, carrying only a single ton to feed the rifle, leaving little room for sustained engagements once that runs dry.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>",
