  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "Let me tell you about this one. It's a quad, and quads never really got respect until this design landed the SLDF contract nobody thought was possible after the Xanthos flopped two centuries back. The engineer named it after his own homeworld in the Free Worlds League, which I always thought was a nice touch. Heavy armor and real agility made up for the light weapons load in the right hands. When the civil war hit, the factory kept changing hands, and eventually its own side blew it up rather than let the Rim Worlds keep the tech.",
